OL,3,GNEWSAChain ferry to close for
OL,4,Aseven-week major refit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chain ferry will be out of action for
OL,7,Fseven weeks while it undergoes a major
OL,8,Frefit.
OL,10,FSandbanks Ferry, which links Poole and
OL,11,FStudland, in Dorset, will be shut from
OL,12,FMonday 2 November.
OL,14,FThe final service will leave Shell Bay
OL,15,Ffor Sandbanks at 23:10 GMT on 1
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FThe refit works will be carried out at
OL,19,FPoole Quay and in Falmouth, Cornwall,
OL,20,Fwith the seven-week schedule subject to
OL,21,Fweather and sea conditions.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
